"\n"
"Sebagai tambahan, proses pengiriman bug telah dijalankan."

#: ../DistUpgrade/DistUpgradeController.py:2338
msgid ""
"The system was unable to get the prerequisites for the upgrade. The upgrade "
"will abort now and restore the original system state.\n"
"\n"
"To report a bug install apport and then execute 'apport-bug ubuntu-release-"
"upgrader'."
msgstr ""
"Sistem tak bisa mendapat prasyarat untuk peningkatan. Peningkatan akan "
"digugurkan sekarang dan mengembalikan keadaan sistem asli.\n"
"\n"
"Untuk melaporkan kutu pasanglah apport lalu jalankan 'apport-bug ubuntu-"
"release-upgrader'."

#: ../DistUpgrade/DistUpgradeController.py:2372
msgid "Updating repository information"
msgstr "Memutakhirkan informasi gudang"

#: ../DistUpgrade/DistUpgradeController.py:2421
msgid "Invalid package information"
msgstr "Informasi paket tidak valid"

#: ../DistUpgrade/DistUpgradeController.py:2422
#, python-format
msgid ""
"After updating your package information, the essential package '%s' could "
"not be located. This may be because you have no official mirrors listed in "
"your software sources, or because of excessive load on the mirror you are "
"using. See /etc/apt/sources.list for the current list of configured software "
"sources.\n"
"In the case of an overloaded mirror, you may want to try the upgrade again "
"later."
msgstr ""
"Setelah memutakhirkan informasi paket Anda, paket esensial '%s' tak dapat "
"ditemukan. Ini mungkin karena Anda tak memiliki cermin resmi yang didaftar "
"dalam sumber perangkat lunak Anda, atau karena muatan berlebih pada cermin "
"yang sedang Anda pakai. Lihat /etc/apt/sources.list untuk daftar saat ini "
"dari sumber-sumber perangkat lunak yang tertata.\n"
"Dalam kasus cermin yang terbeban lebih, Anda mungkin ingin mencoba "
"peningkatan lagi nanti."

